<title>USA: Omaha hogs up $0.50-1.00  - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs up $0.50-1.00  - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.50 to</p>
<p>mostly 1.00 higher. Top $59.75 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    230-260 lbs    59.50-59.75</p>
<p>US 2-3    260-280 lbs    58.75-59.25</p>
<p>Sows: 25 percent. Weak to 2.00 lower. Top 53.00</p>
<p>US 1-3    350-450 lbs    49.00</p>
<p>	    450-500 lbs    50.00</p>
<p>US 2-3    500-700 lbs    51.50-53.00</p>
</text>
